# TypeScript / JavaScript testing

Aligns with `.cursor/rules/testing.mdc`.

## Unit / integration

Prefer **Vitest** or **Jest** depending on **`package.json`**. Mirror **Arrange–Act–Assert** and coverage expectations from the project **testing** rule.

## End-to-end

Use **Playwright** for **critical journeys** where the harness or team requires it — the **`frontend-evaluator`** subagent is Playwright-oriented for runtime product QA when the harness is active; keep Playwright specs and rubric-critical flows aligned.

There is **no dedicated `e2e-runner` agent** here — use **`frontend-evaluator`**, harness flows, or CI Playwright suites as defined in the repo.